    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) Number of technician streghtened capcities on M&amp;E, data collection tools and stock management.
2) Number of management project decison making meetings held.
3) Number of health facility with SIS installed and operational.
4) Number of Provinces supervised regarding the use of thermometers, pharmacovigilance.
5) National formulary validated.
6) Transition project for the new global fund grant NFM stablished.
(Note: The project started in 2015).</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2015">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) 338 technicians has been trained on M&amp;E, data collection tools and stock management.
